Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository is the BotStory fork of iw2d/kaentake (https://github.com/iw2d/kaentake).
Different parts of it are under different terms.

Upstream code
-------------
iw2d/kaentake, and the iw2d/WzLib submodule (external/WzLib), are published without a
licence. Their authors keep all rights to that code. Nothing in this repository grants
any rights to it.

The stat_all_ap and beginner_ap modules (branch mod/loganml-ap) are ported from
LoganML/kaentake, which is also published without a licence. The same applies to the
code taken from it.

BotStory's changes
------------------
The changes made in commits authored by Incluwin (the BotStory fork) are licensed under
the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3. The full text is in
LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.txt. This covers only those changes, not the upstream code they modify
or build on.

Other components
----------------
Microsoft Detours (external/Detours) is under its own MIT licence.

MapleStory and its game data belong to NEXON. Custom.wz contains UI art derived from the
v83 client's own data.
